Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant tables / columns and why they matter  
• `provider_business_practice_location_address_city_name` (npi_optimized) : filter to “Mountain View”  
• `provider_business_practice_location_address_state_name` (npi_optimized) : filter to “CA”  
• `npi` (npi_optimized) : distinct provider identifier we must count  
• `healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_1 … healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_15` (npi_optimized) : taxonomy codes carried by each NPI  
• `code` (healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_set) : taxonomy code to join on  
• `specialization` (healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_set) : specialization description we are interested in.  
Conditions that will be useful  
•  `UPPER(provider_business_practice_location_address_city_name) = 'MOUNTAIN VIEW'`  
•  `provider_business_practice_location_address_state_name = 'CA'`  
•  `specialization IS NOT NULL AND specialization <> ''`  
•  taxonomy code columns are NOT NULL / NOT '' when we un‑pivot them.  

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Ten exploratory → final SQL statements
-------------------------------------------------------------------

```sql
-- 1️⃣  Description: Peek at 20 NPI rows whose practice location city contains “Mountain View”.
SELECT npi,
       provider_business_practice_location_address_city_name   AS city,
       provider_business_practice_location_address_state_name  AS state
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.nppes.npi_optimized`
WHERE  UPPER(provider_business_practice_location_address_city_name) = 'MOUNTAIN VIEW'
  AND  provider_business_practice_location_address_state_name = 'CA'
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 2️⃣  Description: Show the first five taxonomy‑code columns for those Mountain View NPIs.
SELECT npi,
       healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_1 AS code1,
       healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_2 AS code2,
       healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_3 AS code3,
       healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_4 AS code4,
       healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_5 AS code5
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.nppes.npi_optimized`
WHERE  UPPER(provider_business_practice_location_address_city_name) = 'MOUNTAIN VIEW'
  AND  provider_business_practice_location_address_state_name = 'CA'
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 3️⃣  Description: Look‑up the specialization that belongs to a handful of taxonomy codes.
SELECT hc.code,
       hc.classification,
       hc.specialization
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.nppes.healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_set`  AS hc
WHERE  hc.code IN ('207Q00000X','207RE0101X','364S00000X')      -- example codes
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 4️⃣  Description: Un‑pivot Mountain View NPIs to one row per (NPI, taxonomy_code).
SELECT npi,
       code
FROM   `bigquery-public-data.nppes.npi_optimized`,
       UNNEST([
         healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_1,  healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_2,
         healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_3,  healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_4,
         healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_5,  healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_6,
         healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_7,  healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_8,
         healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_9,  healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_10,
         healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_11, healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_12,
         healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_13, healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_14,
         healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_15
       ]) AS code
WHERE  UPPER(provider_business_practice_location_address_city_name) = 'MOUNTAIN VIEW'
  AND  provider_business_practice_location_address_state_name = 'CA'
  AND  code IS NOT NULL AND code <> ''
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 5️⃣  Description: Join the un‑pivoted codes to the taxonomy table to see specializations.
SELECT up.npi,
       hc.specialization
FROM (
       SELECT npi, code
       FROM   `bigquery-public-data.nppes.npi_optimized`,
              UNNEST([
                healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_1,  healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_2,
                healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_3,  healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_4,
                healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_5,  healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_6,
                healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_7,  healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_8,
                healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_9,  healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_10,
                healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_11, healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_12,
                healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_13, healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_14,
                healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_15
              ]) AS code
       WHERE  UPPER(provider_business_practice_location_address_city_name) = 'MOUNTAIN VIEW'
         AND  provider_business_practice_location_address_state_name = 'CA'
         AND  code IS NOT NULL AND code <> ''
     ) AS up
JOIN   `bigquery-public-data.nppes.healthcare_provider_taxonomy_code_set` AS hc
ON     up.code = hc.code
WHERE  hc.specialization IS NOT NULL AND hc.specialization <> ''
LIMIT  20;
```

